{"file_name": "Cover Art 2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1185396463569354", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_1185396466902687_3485502356355162100_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sRIS9gcDeYwQ7kNvwHjMSia&_nc_oc=Adrqvi4Zr2m4_i0daWn0ar4-GotzLv7gDCtmSVlb-d_YkMhvFkUVc18W5btmnK-T618&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRsdTeAMrjjBzndYDDluhPP97BFp41FMz68R67RKyBNJw&oe=6AEB33F2"}, "display_name": "Irusu Cricket VR", "keywords": ["Cricket", "Sports", "Batting", "T20", "Physics"], "long_description": "IRUSU CRICKET VR: THE ULTIMATE QUEST 3 EXPERIENCE\n\nStep onto the pitch with a true-to-life, physics-driven VR cricket simulation built exclusively for Meta Quest 3 and 3s.\n\nREAL BATTING PHYSICS\nExperience 1:1 VR bat tracking. The game calculates sweet spots and power directly from your actual swing. Controller haptics let you physically feel a clean drive versus a thick edge.\n\nSMART AI & REAL MATCHES\nFace 150 km/h bouncers and sharp spin from adaptive AI bowlers. Watch fielders dive for catches in real-time. Play 3, 5, 10, or 20-over matches complete with Power Plays and Super Overs.\n\nTV-STYLE DRS SYSTEM\nChallenge the umpire! Watch cinematic Hawk-Eye, Ultra-Edge (Snicko), and HotSpot reviews unfold on the stadium Jumbotron.\n\nGLOBAL STADIUMS & PROGRESSION\nMaster your swing in Net Practice, then conquer unique pitches in Mumbai, Melbourne, and London. Unlock premium gear, track your stats, and immerse yourself in dynamic crowd roars.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n- 1:1 physics-based batting\n- Adaptive AI bowling & active fielding\n- 3rd Umpire DRS (Hawk-Eye, Snicko, HotSpot)\n- Quick matches to full T20 formats\n- 3 iconic stadiums & Net Practice mode\n- Bat skins, career stats & haptic feedback\n- Feel every ball. Own every shot.", "short_description": "Step onto the crease. Face AI bowlers. Play VR cricket like never before."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.irusu.co.in/privacy-policy-2/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Irusu Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://irusustudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35374249202188459"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1731047901491737"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1047110787667465"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "841656218992788"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "841656218992788"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1731047901491737"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "37931108869835800", "version": "0.4.10"}, "id": "1583115716099970", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "35374249182188461", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "37931108869835800"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789122658, "id": "38687082014238478", "version": "0.4.12", "version_code": 33, "release_status": "PE